    <!-- Private Browsing -->
    <string name="private_browsing_title">Private Browsing</string>
    <string name="private_browsing_body"><![CDATA[
<h1>Private Browsing</h1>
<p>When you close your private tabs, Archwave <strong>forgets</strong> what you did in them:</p>
<ul class="two-column">
    <li>history</li>
    <li>cookies</li>
    <li>site data</li>
    <li>cached files</li>
</ul>
<p>Private tabs <strong>do not make you anonymous</strong>. Websites, your network provider and your employer or school can still see what you do and where you connect from. Files you download are kept.</p>
     ]]></string>

